        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103860/extras/a539d681deccba1a00f28cae3716922e.gif?t=1763954280\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103860/extras/a539d681deccba1a00f28cae3716922e.poster.avif?t=1763954280\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>It appears that you have died. Together we will try to understand how this happened, and maybe see the life you have left behind. Let us discover the vibrant world buzzing with colors and sounds revisiting the cherished moments of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103860/extras/bd41c2340f907c3adaef4c1e40bb4da6.gif?t=1763954280\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103860/extras/bd41c2340f907c3adaef4c1e40bb4da6.poster.avif?t=1763954280\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then again, was your life lived, or was it endured? Did you leave anything behind? What was it that killed you, a sharp stab or something slower? How can we truly know the answers to these questions when you don't even understand how you died. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dev Notes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~1 hour playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colour pickers will let you choose the colours that best suit your eyes, there should be preset colours that work for all forms of colour blindness, if not please feel free to leave a post</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stylised point and click adventure novel, feel free to put down and pick up whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103860/extras/a539d681deccba1a00f28cae3716922e.gif?t=1763954280\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103860/extras/a539d681deccba1a00f28cae3716922e.poster.avif?t=1763954280\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>It appears that you have died. Together we will try to understand how this happened, and maybe see the life you have left behind. Let us discover the vibrant world buzzing with colors and sounds revisiting the cherished moments of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103860/extras/bd41c2340f907c3adaef4c1e40bb4da6.gif?t=1763954280\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103860/extras/bd41c2340f907c3adaef4c1e40bb4da6.poster.avif?t=1763954280\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then again, was your life lived, or was it endured? Did you leave anything behind? What was it that killed you, a sharp stab or something slower? How can we truly know the answers to these questions when you don't even understand how you died. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dev Notes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~1 hour playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colour pickers will let you choose the colours that best suit your eyes, there should be preset colours that work for all forms of colour blindness, if not please feel free to leave a post</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stylised point and click adventure novel, feel free to put down and pick up whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "You have died, and only you can discover how it happened. Do not worry though, I am here to help you. Let us figure this out together. This mixed media artistic point and click adventure novel will not take you long to complete.",
